      "native": {
        "kind": "slide",
        "title": "Classification by selectivity",
        "text": "Classification by selectivity\n\nClass\tExamples\tNote\nNon-selective\tPropranolol, nadolol\tBlock beta-1 and beta-2\nCardioselective\tMetoprolol, atenolol\tSelectivity lost at high doses\nMixed alpha/beta\tCarvedilol, labetalol\tAdd vasodilation",
        "notes": "Cardioselective does not mean cardiac-only.",
        "hidden": false,
        "hasUnextractedObjects": false,
        "blocks": [
