      "native": {
        "kind": "slide",
        "title": "Pharmacokinetics",
        "text": "Pharmacokinetics\n\n• Propranolol: extensive first-pass metabolism\n• Atenolol: renal elimination, t½ about 6-7 h\n• Therapeutic range often quoted as 50-100 µg/mL for older assays\n• Lipophilic agents cross the blood-brain barrier",
        "notes": "Lipophilicity explains the sleep disturbance and vivid dreams reported with propranolol.",
        "hidden": false,
        "hasUnextractedObjects": false,
