        "kind": "slide",
        "title": "Adverse effects",
        "text": "Adverse effects\n\n• Bradycardia and AV block\n• Bronchospasm in asthma with non-selective agents\n• Fatigue, cold extremities\n• Masked hypoglycaemia in insulin-treated diabetes\n• Abrupt withdrawal: rebound tachycardia",
        "notes": "Never stop abruptly. Taper over one to two weeks.",
        "hidden": false,
        "hasUnextractedObjects": false,
        "blocks": [
